/*
  RecentDrivesSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0297 · RecentDrivesSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  RecentDrivesSection resolves (table "RecentDrivesSection") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/vehicle-detail/RecentDrivesSection.tsx). The remainder
  back the native state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner, error retry),
  the sortable Distance header, the "View all" link, and the pagination bar.
*/

